        "comments": "The assembly cbRhaCris3.1 is based on 80x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Order and orientation of scaffolds on Chromosome 1 from\n28.05-30.33Mb, Chromosome 3 from\n17.40-17.59Mb and Chromosome 9 from\n10.27-10.61Mb is unsure.",
